{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/shop_phase.png?t=1743633193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/gif_shop_phase3.gif?t=1743633193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy items, level up, roll for better loot and freeze items for later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Getting 3 of a single item upgrades them into a triple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/combat_phase.png?t=1743633193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/gif_combat_phase.gif?t=1743633193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let your items do the fighting!<br>Some items scale permanently during battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/wild_combos_test.png?t=1743633193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400960/extras/gif_crazy_combo.gif?t=1743633193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get highly synergistic combos that scale exponentially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Async PvP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly synergistic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each round, you can buy new items in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up to earn higher rarity items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_pa